  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Carry your essentials in style with our 100% recycled nylon crossbody tote—part of our On Purpose collection, which is made by a group of 200+ talented artisans from Abahizi Rwanda. An employee-owned and B Corp certified supplier, Abahizi empowers the women who work there through full-time employment, mental-health and well-being support, and healthcare for each employee and her family. Their success is reshaping the lives of 20,000 people in their community.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Nylon</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Lining: fabric</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Gold hardware</li>\n<li><strong>Handle Drop:</strong> Handle drop: 5&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Strap drop: 22&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior: zip pocket</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip closure</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 10.75&quot; (L) x 7.5&quot; (H) x 4.50&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
